    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 480,
        "content": "## CommunityConnect (Supabase + Twilio)\nAll rules live in **Supabase**. This workflow just carries messages in and out.\n\n**Setup (one time)**\n1. **Config** node: paste your Twilio **Account SID** (starts with AC).\n2. Credentials: **Supabase API** (Host = https://zuyqaicvnpwqawfxakjg.supabase.co, Service Role Secret from Supabase \u2192 Project Settings \u2192 API keys) on the 4 Supabase nodes. **Twilio API** on the 2 Twilio nodes. **Stripe API** on *Stripe Payments* (only if you take payments).\n3. Activate. In Twilio \u2192 each shul number \u2192 Messaging \u2192 *A message comes in* \u2192 **Webhook, HTTP POST** \u2192 the **Production URL** of *Twilio Inbound SMS*.\n\n**Flows**\n- Incoming text \u2192 Supabase decides \u2192 texts/calls go out \u2192 result logged \u2192 sender gets \"Message sent\".\n- Every 5 min \u2192 scheduled messages that are due go out.\n- Stripe payment \u2192 signup marked paid / subscription renewed.\n\nThe webhook path is random on purpose \u2014 keep the URL private."
      },
      "id": "a799f1ef-336f-4fb8-bb1e-02d1d6ea3a13",
      "name": "Read Me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -330
      ]
    }
